    "A Yutong assembly plant is planned for Ibadan to support the production of compressed natural gas buses for the national transport initiative."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "President Bola Tinubu has launched a series of initiatives as his administration prepares for the 2027 election cycle. Central to his recent policy announcements is a goal to decrease transport costs by 40% on selected routes from 2027 to 2031. This project will be supported by the introduction of 300 compressed natural gas (CNG) buses, with a production facility scheduled for development in Ibadan. In parallel with these infrastructure and economic plans, the president is intensifying his political activities. His campaign team has confirmed that his itinerary now covers 19 states and the Federal Capital Territory. These developments follow public discussions regarding his administration's policies, including debates over federal recruitment practices and comments from political figures concerning regional voting dynamics and support from members of opposition families.",
